notes.body:
@pquantin - does this look ok to you?

I'm thinking that I wish after processing each LCID it used pdu_lengths[n] rather than each handler needing to advance (or not) offset by the right amount.   Or maybe even check length against expectations so can complain with expert info.

But for now, just want them not to show as unknown...

